-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §120 נוסחת ההמרה: existing second deputies
-- are converted as teaching employees, Y "greater by 10%" than the
-- teachers' of §44, the management allowance left out of X; after
-- placement, the 13% deputyship allowance.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-44`
§ `120 נוסחת ההמרה`

-- (א)(1): "תהיה גדולה ב - 10% מהתוספת הקבועה למורים". F-ofek-hadash-base-120-a:
-- 10% of the teachers' Y, or 10 points. The agreement reads its own "גדול
-- ב־12.5%" (§49) as points, by its example; the reading adopted here is the
-- same, the instrument's own usage — the second exception to convention
-- amounts.increase, recorded there.
@ref akn:art_120__para_a akn:art_120__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN s IS A `status`, b IS A `position base`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a second deputy's Y` s b IS
    `Y on a single base` s b PLUS 10

`a second deputy's Y read as a share` MEANS `Y on a single base` `a regular teacher` `the primary base of 30 weekly hours` TIMES 1.1
`the two readings of a second deputy's Y part` MEANS
    NOT (`a second deputy's Y` `a regular teacher` `the primary base of 30 weekly hours` EQUALS `a second deputy's Y read as a share`)
#ASSERT `the two readings of a second deputy's Y part`

-- (א)(2): the management allowance is not in X.
@ref akn:art_120__para_a__subpara_2
DECLARE `second deputy's pay item` IS ONE OF `the management allowance`, `another item §44(ב) lists`

GIVEN i IS A `second deputy's pay item`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in a second deputy's salary to convert` i IF
    i EQUALS `another item §44(ב) lists`

-- (ב): after placement, the 13% deputyship allowance of §118 (§117(ב)).
@ref akn:art_120__para_b
`a converted second deputy's deputyship rate` MEANS 13%

#ASSERT `a second deputy's Y` `a regular teacher` `the primary base of 30 weekly hours` EQUALS 27
